eproducable in Godot 4.3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 4 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6900 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.13031.3015) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen reordering an entry inside an `Array` in the `Project Settings` (also happens inside the editor settings), the following error appears in the console: `Must be an ancestor of the control.`\n\nThis error is printed by the `ScrollContainer::ensure_control_visible` method.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the `Project Settings`\n2. Navigate to the `Rendering > GL Compatibility` setting\n3. Open the `Force Angle on Devices` setting\n4. Reorder an entry with the left button\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68a80142-9c3d-4b80-99f1-61cf7e34db39)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot needed, can be reproduced on every project.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104491/reaction